olled expansion."], ["Steam","Trade term \u2014 Steam: Oven steam for thin crackling crust."], ["Crumb","Trade term \u2014 Crumb: The interior structure of bread."], ["Sourdough starter","Trade term \u2014 Sourdough starter: Wild yeast and bacteria culture."], ["Levain","Trade term \u2014 Levain: The preferment built from starter."], ["Poolish","Trade term \u2014 Poolish: Wet French preferment."], ["Biga","Trade term \u2014 Biga: Stiff Italian preferment."], ["Lamination","Trade term \u2014 Lamination: Folding butter into dough for flaky layers."], ["Detrempe","Trade term \u2014 Detrempe: The dough base in lamination."], ["Beurrage","Trade term \u2014 Beurrage: The butter block in lamination."], ["Blind bake","Trade term \u2014 Blind bake: Pre-baking a crust before filling."], ["Docking","Trade term \u2014 Docking: Pricking dough to prevent bubbling."], ["Retard","Trade term \u2014 Retard: Slowing fermentation with cold."]];
function ask(n){var out=[],seen={};n=Math.min(n,ITEMS.length);for(var k=0;k<n;k++){var it=ITEMS[(Math.random()*ITEMS.length)|0];out.push("Q"+(k+1)+": "+it[0]+"\nA"+(k+1)+": "+it[1]);}return out.join("\n\n");}
function lookup(q){q=String(q).toLowerCase();var h=[];for(var i=0;i<ITEMS.length;i++){if((ITEMS[i][0]+" "+ITEMS[i][1]).toLowerCase().indexOf(q)>=0)h.push(ITEMS[i][0]+" — "+ITEMS[i][1]);}return h.length?h.join("\n"):"no match for "+q;}
console.log("== drill ==");console.log(ask(5));

